  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q01",
      "source_numbers": ["834"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "把根号内的平方因子提出后，选择所有正确的等式。",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {"id": "A", "text": "$\\sqrt{75}+\\sqrt{48}-\\sqrt{300}=-\\sqrt3$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "B", "text": "$3\\sqrt8+2\\sqrt{18}-\\sqrt{50}=17\\sqrt2$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$\\sqrt{242}-\\sqrt{200}+\\sqrt8=3\\sqrt2$", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify three integer-radicand sums by extracting square factors and combining signed coefficients.", "source_solution": "834.a=(5+4-10)sqrt3=-sqrt3; b=(6+6-5)sqrt2=7sqrt2; c=(11-10+2)sqrt2=3sqrt2. Full solve frozen in independent-solve.md.", "unit_reason": "One transformation-judgment unit contrasts the same signed-coefficient operation across three sums, rather than creating three numerical slots.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Recognition of valid transformations does not demonstrate independently writing all three simplifications; the incorrect claim still requires computing its actual coefficient."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt75=5sqrt3, sqrt48=4sqrt3 and sqrt300=10sqrt3; 5+4-10=-1.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "The actual coefficient is 6+6-5=7, not 17.", "misconception": "Replace the final subtraction by addition after extraction: 6sqrt2+6sqrt2+5sqrt2=17sqrt2."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "242=121*2, 200=100*2, 8=4*2; 11-10+2=3.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q02",
      "source_numbers": ["834"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "选择所有正确的根式化简。",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {"id": "A", "text": "$\\sqrt{54}+\\sqrt{96}-\\sqrt{150}=2\\sqrt6$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "B", "text": "$6\\sqrt{\\frac13}-\\sqrt{12}+\\sqrt3=5\\sqrt3$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$40\\sqrt{\\frac25}-\\sqrt{1000}+2\\sqrt{10}=0$", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify sums including fractional radicands and exact cancellation.", "source_solution": "834.d=(3+4-5)sqrt6=2sqrt6; e=(2-2+1)sqrt3=sqrt3; f=(8-10+2)sqrt10=0, using sqrt(1/3)=sqrt3/3 and sqrt(2/5)=sqrt10/5.", "unit_reason": "One judgment unit makes denominator extraction and zero cancellation part of the same algebraic comparison.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Choice recognizes the transformations; it does not demonstrate writing the rational-radicand derivations unaided."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Extract 9,16,25 from the three radicands; 3+4-5=2.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "6sqrt(1/3)=2sqrt3, so the result is sqrt3.", "misconception": "Use the invalid sqrt(1/3)=sqrt3, obtaining (6-2+1)sqrt3=5sqrt3."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt(2/5)=sqrt10/5 and sqrt1000=10sqrt10; 8-10+2=0.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q03",
      "source_numbers": ["835"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "先精确化简，再用下列平方根表摘录求表算近似值。摘录来自布拉迪斯《四位数数学用表》（2010）表 IV。行标为 $N$；本摘录只有主列 $0$，单元格中的逗号是小数逗号。保留表中小数作运算，不作中间舍入，将表算结果写成三位小数；这不表示真实值的三位小数精度保证。选择所有同时给出正确化简、地址和表算结果的记录。\n\n| $N$ | 主列 $0$ |\n|---|---|\n| 2,0 | 1,414 |\n| 3,0 | 1,732 |\n| 5,0 | 2,236 |",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {"id": "A", "text": "$3\\sqrt2+\\sqrt{32}-\\sqrt{200}=-3\\sqrt2$；行 2,0、主列 0；表算值 $-4.242$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "B", "text": "$2\\sqrt{72}-\\sqrt{50}-2\\sqrt8=-3\\sqrt2$；行 2,0、主列 0；表算值 $-4.242$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$\\sqrt{98}-\\sqrt{72}+\\frac12\\sqrt8=2\\sqrt2$；行 2,0、主列 0；表算值 $2.828$。", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {"task": "Preserve exact simplification followed by actual residual-root address selection and finite-decimal table arithmetic for 835.a,b,f.", "source_solution": "a=-3sqrt2 -> -3*1.414=-4.242; b=3sqrt2 -> 4.242; f=2sqrt2 -> 2.828. All use IV row 2,0, main0 literal 1,414. Frozen capture-36.json r2 pointer and source hashes are in table-provenance.json.", "unit_reason": "Three expressions share one residual root but differ in signed coefficients; judging complete method records requires algebra, address selection and multiplication, not copying a supplied answer.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["The typed frozen-cell excerpt replaces full printed-volume navigation.", "Recognition of a method record does not demonstrate unaided written algebra or physical true-value accuracy."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Coefficient 3+4-10=-3; root2 uses row2,0/main0 ->1.414; -3*1.414=-4.242.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "2sqrt72=12sqrt2, so 12-5-4=3 and the table result is +4.242.", "misconception": "Drop the leading multiplier2 on sqrt72: 6-5-4=-3, then use the otherwise valid root2 cell to get -4.242."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "7-6+(1/2)*2=2; multiply the root2 main cell by2 to get2.828.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q04",
      "source_numbers": ["835"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "先精确化简，再查摘录中的主列 $0$。摘录来自布拉迪斯《四位数数学用表》（2010）表 IV。逗号为小数逗号；用表中小数直接运算，不作中间舍入，将表算结果写成三位小数，不保证真实值的三位小数精度。选择所有正确的完整记录。\n\n| $N$ | 主列 $0$ |\n|---|---|\n| 2,0 | 1,414 |\n| 3,0 | 1,732 |\n| 5,0 | 2,236 |",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {"id": "A", "text": "$5\\sqrt3+\\frac13\\sqrt{27}-\\sqrt{48}=2\\sqrt3$；行 3,0、主列 0；表算值 $3.464$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "B", "text": "$\\sqrt{80}+\\frac12\\sqrt{20}+3\\sqrt{45}=14\\sqrt5$；行 5,0、主列 0；表算值 $31.304$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$\\sqrt{75}-0.1\\sqrt{300}-\\sqrt{27}=-8\\sqrt3$；行 3,0、主列 0；表算值 $-13.856$。", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify 835.c,d,e exactly, identify root3/root5 main addresses and calculate with literal frozen cells.", "source_solution": "c=(5+1-4)sqrt3=2sqrt3 ->3.464; d=(4+1+9)sqrt5=14sqrt5 ->31.304; e=(5-1-3)sqrt3=sqrt3 ->1.732. Use row3,0/main0=1,732 and row5,0/main0=2,236, printed footers35/36; table-provenance.json binds the captures.", "unit_reason": "The unit contrasts fractional multipliers and root-address selection across a common simplify-then-lookup route.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Bounded typed cells replace full-volume navigation; unaided derivation is assessed only through recognition.", "Finite table arithmetic is not a direct-root answer or a true-value guarantee."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "B"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt27=3sqrt3 and sqrt48=4sqrt3; coefficient2; 2*1.732=3.464 at row3,0/main0.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt80=4sqrt5, half sqrt20=sqrt5, 3sqrt45=9sqrt5; 14*2.236=31.304.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "0.1sqrt300=sqrt3, so coefficient5-1-3=1 and result1.732.", "misconception": "Treat0.1 as1: 5-10-3=-8, followed by -8*1.732=-13.856."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q05",
      "source_numbers": ["836"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "展开乘积并合并根式，选择所有正确的等式。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$(3\\sqrt5-2\\sqrt3)\\sqrt5+\\sqrt{60}=15$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$(\\sqrt{28}-2\\sqrt3+\\sqrt7)\\sqrt7+\\sqrt{84}=14$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$(\\sqrt{12}+2\\sqrt{18})\\frac12\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{96}=6-3\\sqrt6$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Distribute radicals, extract square factors and combine cross terms in 836.a,b,c.", "source_solution": "a=15-2sqrt15+2sqrt15=15; b=21-2sqrt21+2sqrt21=21; c=sqrt6+6-4sqrt6=6-3sqrt6.", "unit_reason": "One distribution unit includes complete cancellation and a surviving radical coefficient.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate writing the expansions independently."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Distribute sqrt5 and use sqrt60=2sqrt15; cross terms cancel.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "sqrt28+sqrt7=3sqrt7; multiplication produces21, not14.", "misconception": "Omit the final +sqrt7 inside the parentheses: (2sqrt7-2sqrt3)sqrt7+2sqrt21=14."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt12=2sqrt3, 2sqrt18=6sqrt2; product=sqrt6+6; subtract4sqrt6.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q06",
      "source_numbers": ["836"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "展开乘积或平方，选择所有正确的化简。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$(4\\sqrt3-2\\sqrt6-1)2\\sqrt3=24-12\\sqrt2-1$", "figure_ids": []},
