        {"id": "D", "text": "$3+\\sqrt3=\\sqrt3(3+1)$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "E", "text": "$10-2\\sqrt{10}=\\sqrt{10}(\\sqrt{10}-2)$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Factor all five numerical expressions837.a-e using common radical factors.", "source_solution": "a=sqrt7(sqrt2-1); b=sqrt11(sqrt3+sqrt2); c=sqrt3(sqrt5-sqrt2); d=sqrt3(sqrt3+1); e=sqrt10(sqrt10-2). The corrected e solve is frozen in solve-amendment-837e.md and its amendment receipt; the first erroneous snapshot is preserved.", "unit_reason": "All five share the inverse of distribution; options are factorization claims, not separate requested coefficients.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate producing each factorization without alternatives."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C", "E"], "rationales": [
