        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Correct remaining factor is sqrt3+sqrt2, whose square is5+2sqrt6, not5.", "misconception": "After valid extraction of sqrt11, replace sqrt3+sqrt2 by sqrt(3+2)=sqrt5."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Distribute sqrt3: sqrt15-sqrt6.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "3/sqrt3=sqrt3, so the remaining factor is sqrt3+1.", "misconception": "When taking out sqrt3, leave3 instead of dividing3 by sqrt3; obtain sqrt3(3+1)."},
        {"option_id": "E", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt10*sqrt10=10 and sqrt10*(-2)=-2sqrt10; the corrected factorization expands to the original expression.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q08",
      "source_numbers": ["837"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "在 $a\\ge0,b\\ge0$ 时，选择所有恒成立的因式分解。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$a-5\\sqrt a=\\sqrt a(\\sqrt a-5)$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$b-3\\sqrt b=\\sqrt b(b-3)$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$b-\\sqrt{3b}=\\sqrt b(\\sqrt b-\\sqrt3)$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Factor837.f,g,h over their complete real domains including zero.", "source_solution": "f=sqrt a(sqrt a-5), a>=0; g=sqrt b(sqrt b-3), b>=0; h=sqrt b(sqrt b-sqrt3), b>=0.", "unit_reason": "One variable-factorization unit distinguishes a variable from its radical and retains the domain endpoint.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Recognition does not demonstrate independent factorization."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt a*sqrt a=a on a>=0, including0.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "sqrt b*b=b sqrt b, not b; at b=4 proposed right side2 while left side-2.", "misconception": "Extract sqrt b from b-3sqrt b but fail to divide b by sqrt b, leaving b instead of sqrt b."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "sqrt b*sqrt b=b and sqrt b*sqrt3=sqrt(3b) for b>=0.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q09",
      "source_numbers": ["838"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "选择所有正确的约分结果。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt2+2}{\\sqrt2}=1+\\sqrt2$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac{5+\\sqrt{10}}{\\sqrt{10}}=1+5\\sqrt{10}$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac{2\\sqrt3-3}{5\\sqrt3}=\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{5}$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Reduce838.a,b,c, retaining rational coefficients after division by a radical.", "source_solution": "a=1+sqrt2; b=1+sqrt10/2; c=(2-sqrt3)/5. All denominators are fixed nonzero positive numbers.", "unit_reason": "The shared numerical-radical denominator operation is judged as three complete identities.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Choice does not demonstrate writing the reductions unaided."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "2/sqrt2=sqrt2; the first numerator term gives1.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "5/sqrt10=5sqrt10/10=sqrt10/2.", "misconception": "Replace reciprocal1/sqrt10 by sqrt10 without dividing by10; obtain1+5sqrt10."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Divide numerator and denominator by sqrt3; 3/sqrt3=sqrt3.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q10",
      "source_numbers": ["838"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "变量取实数。选择所有同时给出原式完整定义域及等价化简的记录。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\frac{a\\sqrt b+b\\sqrt a}{\\sqrt{ab}}=\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b$；原式定义域为 $a>0,b>0$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac{x-\\sqrt{ax}}{a\\sqrt x}=\\frac{\\sqrt x-\\sqrt a}{a}$；原式定义域为 $a\\ge0,x>0$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac{y+b\\sqrt y}{b\\sqrt y}=1+\\frac{\\sqrt y}{b}$；原式定义域为 $y>0,b\\ne0$。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Perform all838.d,e,f reductions and determine the full original real domains, including the sign freedom of b.", "source_solution": "d=sqrt a+sqrt b on a>0,b>0. e=(sqrt x-sqrt a)/a on a>0,x>0. f=1+sqrt y/b on y>0,b!=0; negative b permitted. Derivations and necessity of every restriction are frozen.", "unit_reason": "Cancellation and denominator restrictions form one coherent joint judgment, not detachable value and domain slots.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["The response recognizes reductions/domains rather than independently deriving them; both must be checked for each record."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Separate radicals force a,b>=0; nonzero sqrt(ab) forces both>0. Dividing by sqrt a sqrt b leaves sqrt a+sqrt b.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "The algebra is valid for a>0,x>0, but a=0 makes the original denominator zero.", "misconception": "Apply only the radicand condition ax>=0 and x>0, then fail to exclude a=0 from a sqrt x."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Factor sqrt y from numerator; cancel on y>0,b!=0. There is no sqrt b, so b need not be positive.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q11",
      "source_numbers": ["838"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "先寻找共同因子，选择所有正确的约分结果。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\frac{2+\\sqrt2}{1+\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}-\\sqrt5}{1-\\sqrt3}=\\sqrt5$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac{2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt8-2}=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Reduce838.g,h,i by factoring whole binomials, retaining reversed-factor signs and radical coefficients.", "source_solution": "g=sqrt2 since numerator=sqrt2(1+sqrt2). h=-sqrt5 since denominator=-(sqrt3-1). i=sqrt6/2 since numerator=sqrt6(sqrt2-1), denominator=2(sqrt2-1).", "unit_reason": "These three numeric binomial cancellations are one factor-recognition unit distinct from division by a single radical.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate unaided factor construction."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Factor sqrt2(1+sqrt2), then cancel the positive factor1+sqrt2.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "1-sqrt3=-(sqrt3-1), so the quotient is -sqrt5.", "misconception": "Cancel sqrt3-1 with1-sqrt3 as though the factors were identical; lose the factor-1."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "2-sqrt2=sqrt2(sqrt2-1); sqrt8-2=2(sqrt2-1); cancel the nonzero binomial.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q12",
      "source_numbers": ["839"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "选择所有同时保留原式完整实数定义域及正确化简的记录。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\frac{x-\\sqrt x}{\\sqrt x-1}=\\sqrt x$；$x\\ge0$ 且 $x\\ne1$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac{p-2\\sqrt p}{2\\sqrt p-4}=\\frac{\\sqrt p}{2}$；$p\\ge0$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac{a-4}{\\sqrt a-2}=\\sqrt a+2$；$a\\ge0$ 且 $a\\ne4$。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify839.b,d,e by cancellation while retaining removable holes in the original domains.", "source_solution": "b=sqrt x on x>=0,x!=1; d=sqrt p/2 on p>=0,p!=4; e=sqrt a+2 on a>=0,a!=4. Canceled factors cannot restore zero original denominators.", "unit_reason": "A single domain-preserving cancellation unit tests exactly the shared removable-hole distinction.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate independent written factorization or original-domain derivation."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Factor sqrt x(sqrt x-1); cancel only when sqrt x!=1.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "At p=4 the original denominator2sqrt p-4=0, so the domain also requires p!=4.", "misconception": "After canceling sqrt p-2, use the simplified sqrt p/2 domain and restore p=4."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "a-4=(sqrt a-2)(sqrt a+2), retaining a!=4 and a>=0.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q13",
      "source_numbers": ["839"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "选择所有同时给出正确化简和完整实数定义域的记录。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\frac{x+\\sqrt{xy}}{\\sqrt x+\\sqrt y}=\\sqrt x$；$x\\ge0,y\\ge0$ 且 $(x,y)\\ne(0,0)$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac{a+\\sqrt{6a}}{6+\\sqrt{6a}}=\\sqrt{6a}$；$a\\ge0$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac{b-9}{\\sqrt b+3}=\\sqrt b-3$；$b\\ge0$。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Simplify839.a,c,f where nonnegative boundary values must remain and positive denominators do not create extra holes.", "source_solution": "a=sqrt x on nonnegative x,y not both0; c=sqrt(a/6) on a>=0; f=sqrt b-3 on b>=0, including b=9.", "unit_reason": "The unit contrasts positive-denominator cancellation with the one joint zero-denominator boundary, retaining all three operations.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Recognition is not independent production of the canceled forms."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Factor sqrt x(sqrt x+sqrt y). The denominator vanishes only at(0,0); x=0,y>0 is valid.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Cancel sqrt a+sqrt6 to get sqrt a/sqrt6=sqrt(a/6), not sqrt(6a).", "misconception": "After cancellation, replace division by sqrt6 with multiplication by sqrt6."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "b-9=(sqrt b-3)(sqrt b+3); denominator is always>=3 on b>=0.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q14",
      "source_numbers": ["840"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "不用小数近似，选择所有正确的大小关系。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$\\sqrt{2.5}>\\frac{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}{2}$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$\\sqrt{11}-1>\\sqrt5+\\sqrt7$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$\\sqrt2+\\sqrt7<2\\sqrt2+1$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "D", "text": "$\\sqrt5+\\sqrt7>3+\\sqrt3$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Compare all four pairs exactly by positive-side squaring and justified inequalities.", "source_solution": "Signs a>, b<, c>, d>. a squared difference=(sqrt3-sqrt2)^2/4>0; b right sum>sqrt11; c7>(sqrt2+1)^2; d35>27 implies2sqrt35>6sqrt3.", "unit_reason": "One exact-order unit contrasts four different root comparisons and forbids replacing them by decimal lookup.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Selection shows order judgment, not independent writing of each exact proof."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "D"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Both positive; squared difference=(5-2sqrt6)/4=(sqrt3-sqrt2)^2/4>0.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Right square12+2sqrt35>11, hence right>sqrt11>sqrt11-1.", "misconception": "Compare squared quantities but transfer the established larger-right relation in the reversed direction."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "After subtracting sqrt2, compare sqrt7 and sqrt2+1; squared difference4-2sqrt2>0, so left is larger.", "misconception": "Transfer7>3+2sqrt2 into sqrt7<sqrt2+1, reversing order when taking positive square roots."},
        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Squared difference2sqrt35-6sqrt3>0 since35>27; both original sides positive.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q15",
      "source_numbers": ["841"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "利用 $(u-v)(u+v)=u^2-v^2$，选择所有正确的等式。", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$(\\sqrt3-1)(\\sqrt3+1)=2$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$(\\sqrt{11}-3)(\\sqrt{11}+3)=20$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$(\\sqrt{10}+7)(7-\\sqrt{10})=39$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "D", "text": "$(2\\sqrt5+\\sqrt{19})(2\\sqrt5-\\sqrt{19})=-9$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "E", "text": "$(5\\sqrt7-13)(5\\sqrt7+13)=6$", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "F", "text": "$(\\frac12\\sqrt{14}+\\sqrt3)(\\sqrt3-\\frac12\\sqrt{14})=\\frac12$", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Apply difference of squares to all six products841.a-f, including reordered terms and squared multipliers.", "source_solution": "Results in order2,2,39,1,6,-1/2: 3-1;11-9;49-10;20-19;175-169;3-14/4.", "unit_reason": "One formula-application unit tests recognizing the leading squared term despite order and coefficient changes.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate independent written simplification."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C", "E"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "3-1=2.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Difference is11-9=2.", "misconception": "Use a sum of squares for the conjugate product:11+9=20."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Reorder as(7+sqrt10)(7-sqrt10)=49-10=39.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "D", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "(2sqrt5)^2=4*5=20, so difference1.", "misconception": "Square only the radical and keep coefficient2 unsquared:2*5-19=-9."},
        {"option_id": "E", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "(5sqrt7)^2=25*7=175; 175-169=6.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "F", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Here u=sqrt3 and v=sqrt14/2;3-14/4=-1/2.", "misconception": "Choose the first-written sqrt14/2 as the minuend even though the second factor is sqrt3-sqrt14/2; calculate14/4-3=1/2."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q16",
      "source_numbers": ["842"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "令 $P=\\frac1{3\\sqrt2-4}-\\frac1{3\\sqrt2+4}$，$Q=\\frac1{5+2\\sqrt6}+\\frac1{5-2\\sqrt6}$。哪一组通分计算正确地证明了两式的值都是有理数？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$P=\\frac8{18-16}=4$，$Q=\\frac{10}{25-24}=10$；两式各分母均非零。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$P=\\frac8{18+16}=\\frac4{17}$，$Q=\\frac{10}{25+24}=\\frac{10}{49}$；两式各分母均非零。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$P=\\frac{-8}{18-16}=-4$，$Q=\\frac{10}{25-24}=10$；两式各分母均非零。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Preserve both rationality proofs842.a,b, not merely ask for two numerical values.", "source_solution": "P numerator=(3sqrt2+4)-(3sqrt2-4)=8, denominator18-16=2, giving4. Q numerator=(5-2sqrt6)+(5+2sqrt6)=10, denominator25-24=1, giving10. Nonzero original denominators follow18!=16 and25!=24.", "unit_reason": "A coherent pair of proof calculations contrasts subtraction and addition over conjugate denominators.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Choosing a complete proof calculation does not demonstrate independently writing a proof."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Both common denominators are differences of squares; their radical numerator terms cancel with the indicated signs.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Conjugate products produce18-16 and25-24, not sums.", "misconception": "Use(a-b)(a+b)=a^2+b^2 for both common denominators, retaining otherwise correct numerators."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "P numerator is the second denominator minus the first, giving+8.", "misconception": "Reverse the common-numerator subtraction forP: (3sqrt2-4)-(3sqrt2+4)=-8."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q17",
      "source_numbers": ["843"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "先用共轭因式精确化简，再查下列平方根表主列 $0$ 的摘录。摘录来自布拉迪斯《四位数数学用表》（2010）表 IV。逗号为小数逗号；不要先用近似小数计算原分母的倒数。用表中小数直接作加减，不作中间舍入，将表算结果写成三位小数，不保证真实值的三位小数精度。选择所有正确的完整记录。\n\n| $N$ | 主列 $0$ |\n|---|---|\n| 2,0 | 1,414 |\n| 3,0 | 1,732 |\n| 5,0 | 2,236 |\n| 7,0 | 2,646 |\n| 10, | 3,162 |",
        "figure_ids": [], "options": [
