          {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac3{\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt7}=\\sqrt{10}-\\sqrt7$；取行 10, 和 7,0、主列 0；表算值 $0.516$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac1{\\sqrt5-2}=\\sqrt5+2$；取行 5,0、主列 0；表算值 $4.236$。", "figure_ids": []}
        ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Rationalize843.a,b,c exactly, then select main cells and calculate table-derived decimals.", "source_solution": "a=sqrt5+sqrt3 ->2.236+1.732=3.968; b=sqrt10-sqrt7 ->3.162-2.646=.516; c=sqrt5+2 ->4.236. Denominators after conjugation2,3,1. Literal rows and hashes are in table-provenance.json; no correction required.", "unit_reason": "One rationalize-then-lookup unit contrasts conjugate signs and two-root versus one-root address selection.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Typed frozen cells replace full-volume navigation.", "Choosing the record does not demonstrate unaided rationalization; supplied cells are input data, not supplied final values.", "No true-value accuracy or historical-equivalence guarantee."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["B", "C"], "rationales": [
