        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Multiply by sqrt10-sqrt7; denominator10-7=3 cancels3. Look up both residual roots then subtract3.162-2.646=.516.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Conjugate sqrt5+2 makes denominator5-4=1;2.236+2=4.236.", "misconception": null}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q18",
      "source_numbers": ["843"],
      "view": {"mode": "multiple", "stem": "先用共轭因式精确化简，再查下列主列 $0$ 摘录。摘录来自布拉迪斯《四位数数学用表》（2010）表 IV。逗号为小数逗号；不要先用近似小数计算原分母的倒数。用表中小数运算，不作中间舍入，将表算结果写成三位小数，不保证真实值的三位小数精度。选择所有正确的完整记录。\n\n| $N$ | 主列 $0$ |\n|---|---|\n| 2,0 | 1,414 |\n| 3,0 | 1,732 |\n| 5,0 | 2,236 |\n| 7,0 | 2,646 |\n| 10, | 3,162 |",
        "figure_ids": [], "options": [
