          {"id": "B", "text": "$\\frac1{9-4\\sqrt5}=9-4\\sqrt5$；取行 5,0、主列 0；表算值 $0.056$。", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "C", "text": "$\\frac1{5\\sqrt2-7}=7+5\\sqrt2$；取行 2,0、主列 0；表算值 $14.070$。", "figure_ids": []}
