      "intent": {"task": "Preserve843.d,e,f exact conjugate reductions followed by root7/root5/root2 literal-cell arithmetic.", "source_solution": "d=4(3-sqrt7)/(9-7)=6-2sqrt7 ->.708. e=(9+4sqrt5)/(81-80)=9+4sqrt5 ->17.944. f=(5sqrt2+7)/(50-49)=7+5sqrt2 ->14.070. All row/main0 bindings are frozen in table-provenance.json.", "unit_reason": "One unit concentrates on coefficients and severe cancellation, making the order of exact rationalization before lookup essential.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Excerpt navigation and method recognition replace full-volume lookup and independently written derivations.", "Finite table decimals do not promise physical true-value accuracy or historical table equivalence."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A", "C"], "rationales": [
