    {
      "id": "q19",
      "source_numbers": ["844"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "对任意 $a\\ge0,b\\ge0$，令 $L=\\sqrt{\\frac{a+b}{2}}$，$T=\\frac{\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b}{2}$。哪一论证完整地给出了正确的不等式及等号条件？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$L,T\\ge0$，且 $L^2-T^2=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{4}\\ge0$，故 $L\\ge T$；等号当且仅当 $a=b$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$L,T\\ge0$，且 $L^2-T^2=-\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{4}\\le0$，故 $L\\le T$；等号当且仅当 $a=b$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$L,T\\ge0$，且 $L^2-T^2=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{4}\\ge0$，故 $L\\ge T$；等号当且仅当 $ab=0$。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Preserve the proof of844 for every nonnegative pair, including why squaring preserves order; make equality explicit.", "source_solution": "Both sides nonnegative; squared difference=(a+b-2sqrt(ab))/4=(sqrt a-sqrt b)^2/4>=0. Hence L>=T, equality iff a=b, including0.", "unit_reason": "A complete proof judgment preserves sign premises and the decisive squared difference, rather than selecting a bare inequality.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Recognition of a proof is not production of an independent proof.", "Equality characterization is an explicit mathematically derived extension of the requested inequality."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Expand T^2=(a+b+2sqrt(ab))/4 and subtract from L^2=(a+b)/2. Nonnegativity permits order transfer; square difference0 iff a=b.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "The squared difference has positive, not negative, sign.", "misconception": "Compute T^2-L^2, but label it L^2-T^2; transfer the reversed inequality."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "At a=0,b=1, squared difference1/4>0 despite ab=0; equality requires sqrt a=sqrt b.", "misconception": "Import the equality condition ab=0 from sqrt(a+b)<=sqrt a+sqrt b instead of solving the present square difference=0."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q20",
      "source_numbers": ["845"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "对任意 $a\\ge0,b\\ge0$，比较 $M=\\frac{a+b}{2}$ 与 $G=\\sqrt{ab}$。哪一完整论证正确？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$M-G=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{2}\\ge0$，所以 $M\\ge G$；等号当且仅当 $a=b$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$M-G=-\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{2}\\le0$，所以 $M\\le G$；等号当且仅当 $a=b$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "$M-G=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{2}\\ge0$，所以 $M\\ge G$；等号当且仅当 $a=0$ 或 $b=0$。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Compare arithmetic and geometric means845 on the full nonnegative domain with an exact justification.", "source_solution": "(a+b)/2-sqrt(ab)=(sqrt a-sqrt b)^2/2>=0; equality exactlya=b.", "unit_reason": "One proof-comparison unit makes both universal order and equality part of the mathematical judgment.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Choosing a proof does not demonstrate independently writing it.", "Equality characterization is a derived extension, not a sourced added condition."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Expand the square to a+b-2sqrt(ab); divide by2. It vanishes exactlya=b.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "The displayed negative square equals G-M, not M-G.", "misconception": "Reverse the subtraction while keeping the original names, yielding the reversed mean inequality."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "a=0,b=1 givesM=1/2,G=0, not equality. Equality requires both roots equal.", "misconception": "Set only the cross term sqrt(ab) to0, instead of the entire squared difference, and infer equality."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q21",
      "source_numbers": ["846"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "实数参数 $s,m,a$ 给定，从 $s=\\frac{m(a+b)}{a-b}$ 解出实数 $b$，并保留原式要求 $b\\ne a$。哪一分类完整正确？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "若 $s+m\\ne0$ 且 $am\\ne0$，唯一解为 $b=\\frac{a(s-m)}{s+m}$；若 $s+m=0$ 且 $am=0$，所有 $b\\ne a$ 都是解；其余情况无解。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "若 $s+m\\ne0$，唯一解为 $b=\\frac{a(s-m)}{s+m}$；若 $s+m=0$，无解。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "若 $s-m\\ne0$ 且 $am\\ne0$，唯一解为 $b=\\frac{a(s+m)}{s-m}$；若 $s-m=0$ 且 $am=0$，所有 $b\\ne a$ 都是解；其余情况无解。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Solve846.a without losing zero-parameter families or admitting a canceled denominator zero.", "source_solution": "(s+m)b=a(s-m). If s+m!=0, candidateb=a(s-m)/(s+m) hasb-a=-2am/(s+m), validiffam!=0. Ifs+m=0, requiream=0; then everyb!=a, otherwise none.", "unit_reason": "A single complete parameter classification preserves rearrangement and exceptional cases; separating formula and exceptions would hide the original denominator contract.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Recognizing a classification does not demonstrate deriving it unaided.", "Complete real-parameter classification is explicit; no unstated physical positivity is introduced."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Multiply only on b!=a; collect(s+m)b=a(s-m). Candidate violatesb!=a exactlyam=0. At s+m=0, the remaining condition is-2am=0.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "It admitsb=a whenam=0 and misses the all-b!=a family ats+m=0,am=0.", "misconception": "Divide bys+m without tracking the canceled original denominator; treat division byzero as automatically no solution."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Collecting b gives s+m, nots-m. For a=m=1,s=2 correctb=1/3, proposedb=3.", "misconception": "Move the -sb term and ma term with wrong signs, obtaining(s-m)b=a(s+m), then classify that incorrect equation."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q22",
      "source_numbers": ["846"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "实数 $d,h$ 给定，从 $d^2=2Rh\\left(1+\\frac h{2R}\\right)$ 解出实数 $R$，保留原式要求 $R\\ne0$。哪一分类完整正确？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "若 $h\\ne0$ 且 $d^2\\ne h^2$，唯一解为 $R=\\frac{d^2-h^2}{2h}$；若 $h=0,d=0$，所有 $R\\ne0$ 都是解；其余情况无解。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "若 $h\\ne0$ 且 $d^2+h^2\\ne0$，唯一解为 $R=\\frac{d^2+h^2}{2h}$；若 $h=0,d=0$，所有 $R\\ne0$ 都是解；其余情况无解。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "C", "text": "若 $h\\ne0$，唯一解为 $R=\\frac{d^2-h^2}{2h}$；若 $h=0,d=0$，所有实数 $R$ 都是解；其余情况无解。", "figure_ids": []}
      ]},
      "intent": {"task": "Solve846.b withh=0 andR=0 restrictions explicitly preserved.", "source_solution": "OnR!=0, expand tod^2=2Rh+h^2. Forh!=0 candidateR=(d^2-h^2)/(2h), validiffd^2!=h^2. Forh=0,d=0 all nonzeroR; forh=0,d!=0 none.", "unit_reason": "One algebraic classification joins expansion, division and original denominator restrictions, rather than an isolated formula slot.", "concept_blocks": [], "limitations": ["Does not demonstrate independent written rearrangement.", "No physical positivity assumptions are added to the source's algebraic formula."], "figure_observations": []},
      "key": {"correct": ["A"], "rationales": [
        {"option_id": "A", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "Expand2Rh+h^2, subtracth^2, divide only whenh!=0, then exclude a zero candidateR. Withh=0, equationd^2=0.", "misconception": null},
        {"option_id": "B", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "The expansion addsh^2 on the right, so moving it left requires subtraction.", "misconception": "Move +h^2 to the left without changing its sign; obtain2Rh=d^2+h^2."},
        {"option_id": "C", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "It permitsR=0 when d^2=h^2 and includesR=0 in the zero-parameter family, although the original h/(2R) is undefined.", "misconception": "Use only the domain of the expanded equation after canceling2R, forgetting the original R!=0 restriction."}
      ]}
    },
    {
      "id": "q23",
      "source_numbers": ["847"],
      "view": {"mode": "single", "stem": "求实数方程 $x^2-27x=0$ 与 $3y^2-7y=0$ 的完整解集。哪一组正确？", "figure_ids": [], "options": [
        {"id": "A", "text": "$x\\in\\{0,27\\}$，$y\\in\\{0,\\frac73\\}$。", "figure_ids": []},
        {"id": "B", "text": "$x\\in\\{27\\}$，$y\\in\\{\\frac73\\}$。", "figure_ids": []},
